OL,3,GNEWSAHow 1930s nobility rewarded their
OL,4,Aservants at Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut at Ickworth House, the servants
OL,7,Fwere often rewarded and a current
OL,8,Fexhibition has been transporting
OL,9,Fvisitors back to the 1930s to see how
OL,10,Fthe household celebrated the festive
OL,11,Fperiod.
